@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor LOGIC_COLOR_T4
skinparam classBackgroundColor LOGIC_COLOR

Class ArchiveCommandParser
Class UnarchiveCommandParser
Class ContextArgumentParser

Class "{abstract}\nCommand" as Command
Class ArchiveCommand
Class UnarchiveCommand
Class "{abstract}\nSetArchivedByContextCommand" as SetArchivedByContextCommand
Class ArchiveByContextCommand
Class UnarchiveByContextCommand

Class Model MODEL_COLOR
Class Context MODEL_COLOR

Command <|-down- ArchiveCommand
Command <|-down- UnarchiveCommand
Command <|-down- SetArchivedByContextCommand
SetArchivedByContextCommand <|-down- ArchiveByContextCommand
SetArchivedByContextCommand <|-down- UnarchiveByContextCommand

SetArchivedByContextCommand -right->"1" Context
SetArchivedByContextCommand .right.> Model : <<call>>

ArchiveCommandParser .up.> ArchiveCommand
ArchiveCommandParser .up.> ArchiveByContextCommand
UnarchiveCommandParser .up.> UnarchiveCommand
UnarchiveCommandParser .up.> UnarchiveByContextCommand
ArchiveCommandParser -right-> ContextArgumentParser
UnarchiveCommandParser -left-> ContextArgumentParser

note bottom of ContextArgumentParser
  Dotted arrows from a parser:
  <<create>> the command
end note
@enduml
